99,"state":"uploaded","updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:37:37Z","uploader":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25813408?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melon-bun","id":25813408,"login":"melon-bun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODEzNDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun","user_view_type":"public"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-bun/SubscribeFlow/releases/assets/670953442"}],"assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-bun/SubscribeFlow/releases/422448065/assets","author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25813408?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/melon-bun","id":25813408,"login":"melon-bun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODEzNDA4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/melon-bun","user_view_type":"public"},"body":"# 知流 0.5.1\n\n本版加入笔记与 AI 总结，并统一为「静流」视觉风格。\n\n- **留下点什么**：通用笔记、项目笔记与「在用／观望／放弃」判断；可选择不写笔记，保存后在独立笔记页浏览、检索和编辑。\n- **按需 AI 总结**：独立选择服务、长度与语言，生成结果先进入可编辑草稿，保存后才成为正式笔记；保护等待期间的新输入。\n- **全新界面**：浅色／深色纸面布局、优先级信号条、平台标识和可关闭的轻科幻特效；品牌 logo 恢复白底原图。\n- **分段切换动画**：平台筛选和模式页签的选中底色平滑滑动，尊重系统减少动态效果设置。\n- **交互稳定性**：修复渠道筛选时的骨架闪烁、栏宽／高度跳变，以及内容总览、渠道、标签和笔记的侧栏高亮闪烁；完善长文字与短窗口显示。\n- **README 与截图**：按当前功能重写更新说明，重新截取收件箱、深色主题、笔记、日历、看板、标签、渠道和链接收录八张界面图。\n\n安装包为 **macOS Intel（x64）**，内置 Electron 与 Python 运行环境。退出旧版后替换 `.app`；升级前建议备份本地数据目录。\n\nAI 功能可选，需要自行配置可用服务。详情读数中标为「示例数据」的部分仍为视觉样例。\n安装包采用本机 ad-hoc 签名，未经过 Apple 公证；首次启动的 macOS 提示与此前版本相同。\n","created_at":"2026-10-24T01:36:55Z","draft":true,"html_url":"https://github.com/melon-bun/SubscribeFlow/releases/tag/untagged-d3bb34549f37d9db6f62","id":422448065,"immutable":false,"name":"知流 0.5.1","node_id":"RE_kwDOU8i_As4ZLgvB","prerelease":false,"published_at":null,"tag_name":"v0.5.1","tarball_url":null,"target_commitish":"main","updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:38:03Z","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/melon-bun/SubscribeFlow/releases/422448065/assets{?name,label}","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/melon-bun/SubscribeFlow/releases/422448065","zipball_url":null}
